      "updated_at": "2018-11-10T00:43:21Z",
      "body": "Thanks for the explanation @bitpshr. I think it's easy to misunderstand the behavior of \"Privacy mode\" given the name. We also expected connect requests to not show as long as this was off.\r\n\r\nPerhaps something like \"Legacy Support\" with the on/off meanings switched (Privacy mode \"off\" == Legacy support \"on\") would've reduced confusion a bit. I guess either way it'll all be removed soon, so it's no big deal.",
