      "created_at": "2018-12-08T18:44:45Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-12-08T18:48:59Z",
      "body": "For future visitors: \r\nYou can avoid the popup if privacy mode is turned off by checking if window.ethereum.selectedAccount is undefined. If it is undefined, then attempt to enable.\r\n\r\nSomething like:\r\n```javascript\r\nif (window.ethereum) {\r\n      try {\r\n         if (typeof window.ethereum.selectedAddress === 'undefined') {\r\n                await window.ethereum.enable();\r\n                window.web3 = new Web3(window.ethereum);\r\n          }\r\n          else {\r\n                window.web3 = new Web3(window.ethereum);\r\n          }\r\n      } catch (error) {\r\n            alert('You denied access to your metamask. You will not be able to utilize the site.');\r\n      }\r\n}\r\n\r\n```",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
